                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-fun">1. Subject Pronouns (Pronoms Sujets)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs mb-3">
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">I</strong> = Je (⚠️ Toujours majuscule !)</div>
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">You</strong> = Tu / Vous (Masculin & Féminin)</div>
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">He</strong> = Il (Garçon / Homme)</div>
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">She</strong> = Elle (Fille / Femme)</div>
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">It</strong> = Il / Elle (Objet, Animal)</div>
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">We</strong> = Nous</div>
                        <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg"><strong class="text-blue-600">They</strong> = Ils / Elles</div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
                        📌 <strong>À retenir :</strong> L'anglais ne fait pas la différence entre "tu" et "vous", on utilise toujours <strong>you</strong>.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 2: Le Verbe BE -->
                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-md transition">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-blue-600">
                        <span class="text-2xl">✨</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-fun">2. Verb BE (Être)</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">Pour se présenter, donner son âge, sa nationalité, sa personnalité :</p>
                    <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-700 mb-3">
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex justify-between"><span>I <strong>am</strong> (12 years old)</span><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">I'm</span></li>
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex justify-between"><span>You <strong>are</strong> (very tall)</span><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">You're</span></li>
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex justify-between"><span>He / She / It <strong>is</strong> (happy)</span><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">He's / She's / It's</span></li>
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg flex justify-between"><span>We / You / They <strong>are</strong> (ready)</span><span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">We're / They're</span></li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded-lg">
                        ⚠️ <strong>Attention :</strong> Pour l'âge, on dit <em>I am 12 years old</em> (et NON "I have").
                    </p>
                </div>

