                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg">I <strong>have</strong> a dog and two cats.</li>
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg">You <strong>have</strong> a blue backpack.</li>
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg font-medium">He / She / It <strong>HAS</strong> dark eyes. <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">(Attention au 's' !)</span></li>
                        <li class="p-1.5 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg">We / You / They <strong>have</strong> good manners.</li>
                    </ul>
